{"2957870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Urok", "steam_appid": 2957870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTROL THE ELEMENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the elemental resources bend to your will. Transform the flames of a forest into a blazing fireball, or cause lakes to vanish, rising mist that cloaks the world in shadow. Strategize ahead, shaping the environment to your advantage, and combine resources to cast devastating spells.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957870/extras/5be6ca573f69f7971c47dbb03268d7c4.poster.avif?t=1786311902\" width=1320 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957870/extras/5be6ca573f69f7971c47dbb03268d7c4.webm?t=1786311902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957870/extras/5be6ca573f69f7971c47dbb03268d7c4.mp4?t=1786311902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECT SPELL CARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose wisely from the cards that come your way. Discover endless combinations and utilities for each spell card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957870/extras/f7db9813d0d02db746a13fa7ba34b29a.avif?t=1786311902\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957870/extras_big/f7db9813d0d02db746a13fa7ba34b29a.avif?t=1786311902 width=800 height=290 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REACT TO YOUR FOES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be aware of your surroundings, for the world is full of both danger and opportunity. Turn-based combat gives you the chance to react to opponents’ spells or plan ahead, layering spells for unique effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957870/extras/177fa67884a50a121196f37e9f5a3981.poster.avif?t=1786311902\" width=630 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957870/extras/177fa67884a50a121196f37e9f5a3981.webm?t=1786311902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957870/extras/177fa67884a50a121196f37e9f5a3981.mp4?t=1786311902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use hexagonal tiles with elemental resources (fire, water, wood, stone, and air) to cast powerful spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the environment to your advantage by manipulating the natural elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast devastating spells to overcome foul creatures and obstacles in your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your moves in strategic turn-based combat to outwit enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new spell cards for endless strategic possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a cursed land and encounter mysterious figures on your journey.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTROL THE ELEMENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the elemental resources bend to your will. Transform the flames of a forest into a blazing fireball, or cause lakes to vanish, rising mist that cloaks the world in shadow. Strategize ahead, shaping the environment to your advantage, and combine resources to cast devastating spells.<span cl